  "sources": [
    {
      "name": "azure-isolated-spokes.tf.json",
      "content": "{\n  \"terraform\": {\n    \"required_providers\": {\n      \"azurerm\": {\n        \"source\": \"hashicorp/azurerm\",\n        \"version\": \"~> 4.0\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"variable\": {\n    \"subscription_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"provider\": {\n    \"azurerm\": {\n      \"features\": [\n        {}\n      ],\n      \"subscription_id\": \"${var.subscription_id}\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"resource\": {\n    \"azurerm_resource_group\": {\n      \"hub\": {\n        \"name\": \"rg-hub\",\n        \"location\": \"koreacentral\"\n      },\n      \"orders\": {\n        \"name\": \"rg-orders\",\n        \"location\": \"koreacentral\"\n      },\n      \"finance\": {\n        \"name\": \"rg-finance\",\n        \"location\": \"koreacentral\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"azurerm_virtual_network\": {\n      \"hub\": {\n        \"name\": \"vnet-hub\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.hub.name}\",\n        \"location\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.hub.location}\",\n        \"address_space\": [\n          \"10.80.0.0/16\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"orders\": {\n        \"name\": \"vnet-orders\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.orders.name}\",\n        \"location\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.orders.location}\",\n        \"address_space\": [\n          \"10.81.0.0/16\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"finance\": {\n        \"name\": \"vnet-finance\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.finance.name}\",\n        \"location\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.finance.location}\",\n        \"address_space\": [\n          \"10.82.0.0/16\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"azurerm_subnet\": {\n      \"hub\": {\n        \"name\": \"hub-private\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.hub.name}\",\n        \"virtual_network_name\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.hub.name}\",\n        \"address_prefixes\": [\n          \"10.80.1.0/24\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"orders\": {\n        \"name\": \"orders-private\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.orders.name}\",\n        \"virtual_network_name\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.orders.name}\",\n        \"address_prefixes\": [\n          \"10.81.1.0/24\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"finance\": {\n        \"name\": \"finance-private\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.finance.name}\",\n        \"virtual_network_name\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.finance.name}\",\n        \"address_prefixes\": [\n          \"10.82.1.0/24\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"azurerm_virtual_network_peering\": {\n      \"orders_to_hub\": {\n        \"name\": \"orders-to-hub\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.orders.name}\",\n        \"virtual_network_name\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.orders.name}\",\n        \"remote_virtual_network_id\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.hub.id}\",\n        \"allow_forwarded_traffic\": false\n      },\n      \"hub_to_orders\": {\n        \"name\": \"hub-to-orders\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.hub.name}\",\n        \"virtual_network_name\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.hub.name}\",\n        \"remote_virtual_network_id\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.orders.id}\",\n        \"allow_forwarded_traffic\": false\n      },\n      \"finance_to_hub\": {\n        \"name\": \"finance-to-hub\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.finance.name}\",\n        \"virtual_network_name\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.finance.name}\",\n        \"remote_virtual_network_id\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.hub.id}\",\n        \"allow_forwarded_traffic\": false\n      },\n      \"hub_to_finance\": {\n        \"name\": \"hub-to-finance\",\n        \"resource_group_name\": \"${azurerm_resource_group.hub.name}\",\n        \"virtual_network_name\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.hub.name}\",\n        \"remote_virtual_network_id\": \"${azurerm_virtual_network.finance.id}\",\n        \"allow_forwarded_traffic\": false\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
    }
  ],
  "warnings": [
    "원본 Terraform 설정을 그대로 보관합니다. 변수 기본값·문자열·주석에 비밀정보가 포함되어 있다면 가져오기 전에 제거하세요.",
    "count/for_each는 리소스 선언 하나로 표시합니다. 로컬·원격 모듈은 내부를 실행하거나 펼치지 않습니다."
